  AttackDescription: Give someone a nice compliment
  AttackMessageDescription: complimented
  DialogueChance: 1
  DialogueOptions:
  - Your eyebrows look good!
  - You speak at an adequate volume!
  - You look like your hugs are not bad at all!
  - I bet your shoes have pretty shoelaces!
  - Your feet don't even smell that bad!
  - If I had a gold nugget for each of your insecurities I would probably have none!
  - You are loved!
  - You must be really good at picking what movies to watch!
  - I would leave no crumbs if you were the cook!
  - I like your sprite!
  - I would let you choose the music in a roadtrip!
  - Your posture is completely normal and exudes confidence!
  - You ears are a normal size!
  - I bet you make your bed every morning!
  - You look like you could kill a fly but choose not to!
  DialogueDuration: 3
